# Schema
- id: Primitive(Long) nullable=false
- price: Primitive(Decimal(DecimalType { precision: 10, scale: 2 })) nullable=true
- percentage: Primitive(Decimal(DecimalType { precision: 5, scale: 4 })) nullable=true
- large_number: Primitive(Decimal(DecimalType { precision: 18, scale: 6 })) nullable=true
- currency: Primitive(Decimal(DecimalType { precision: 15, scale: 3 })) nullable=true

# Data
+----+--------+------------+----------------+-----------+
| id | price  | percentage | large_number   | currency  |
